Example agent tool schema for NULLXES integrations:

{
  "name": "search_docs",
  "description": "Query internal NULLXES documentation",
  "parameters": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "query": {"type": "string"},
      "limit": {"type": "integer", "default": 5}
    },
    "required": ["query"]
  }
}

Agents serialize tool results as plain text before the next Murzik forward pass.
